 - 2026-06-17: PHASE D1 (ARC north star; UNSTALL the exp4307 harness failure) -- monotonic ARC +1 on a NEW game (total_levels >= 23) with a FRONTIER-ADAPTER-FREE solver. .398 (exp4307) STALLED at 22 and was FLAGGED GATE_PASSED_WITHOUT_DATA: it selected a game but exploration_actions_used=0 and real_env_confirmed=false because the frontier adapter was unavailable -- a HARNESS failure, not a science failure. .399 removes the adapter dependency: use the TRAINING-FREE GRAPH-EXPLORE solver (arXiv:2512.24156 -- segment frames into components, prioritize actions by visual salience, maintain a directed state-transition graph, take the shortest path to an untested state-action pair; median 30/52 levels with NO learning) so the solve does NOT depend on an unavailable adapter. Target the best-headroom UNATTEMPTED game from the 25-game survey (NOT r11l/ls20/wa30/sc25). HARD anti-flag gate (the exp4307 flag must NOT recur): exploration_actions_used>0 AND real_env_confirmed=true AND offline_reproduced=true (per ARC Solve Reproducibility Discipline -- only offline-reproduced levels count). Advance ONE game by >=1 NEW real-env-confirmed level (total 22 -> >=23). Report total_levels + game_advanced + levels_completed + exploration_actions_used + offline_reproduced. NO TRM training; NO leaderboard submission. An honest no-advance WITH exploration_actions_used>0 is COMPLETE and informs the next game pick (a no-advance with 0 actions is the flag to avoid). (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: adapter_free_incremental_progress_cd82-fb555c5d_advanced_to_L1_total23; results/experiment_4317_arc_incremental_progress_adapter_free.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE E1 (CONTINUOUS SELF-LEARNING -- the mandated self-learning experiment; NEW mechanism = cross-game transfer) -- does the ARC learned verifier (arc_value_learner: state->steps-to-go), trained on the SOLVED games' solve traces, reduce SEARCH STATES on a HELD-OUT game (leave-one-game-out)? research-program.md mandates >=1 self-learning experiment/milestone. .398 (exp4306) PROVED online/retrieval adaptation HELPS (+0.529, powered) -- so re-measuring it is churn; the NEW frontier (per ops/verifier_registry.yaml: 'cross-game verifier transfer: not yet pursued; POC is per-game value head') is whether a value-head trained on OTHER games transfers its search-efficiency benefit to a new game. This is the north-star EFFICIENCY axis (fewer search states = more efficient solve, the Exp1165 ~4x-fewer-actions thesis) + the self-learning mandate in ONE. Train arc_value_learner on the reproducibly-solved games' traces (r11l/ls20/wa30/lp85); test LEAVE-ONE-GAME-OUT: does the transferred value-head reduce OfflineSolver search states on the held-out game vs an untrained/uniform heuristic? Report cross_game_state_reduction (held-out states_uniform / states_transferred) + per-held-out-game reads. Honest null (per-game heads do NOT transfer, reduction ~1.0) LOGS a 'game-invariant ARC value representation' missing-verifier gap. verifier_is_oracle=false. NO TRM training; NO live-LoRA; NO weight mutation of any LLM (the value-head is a tiny learned heuristic over solver state, CPU). (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete: arc_cross_game_value_head_no_improvement_positive_control_passed; results/experiment_4318_arc_cross_game_learned_verifier_transfer.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE F1 (OFF-ARC EXECUTION-VERIFIER TRANSFER; GAP-CODE-EXEC-DEMOFIT; known-issues MANDATORY 2026-06-11; decentralization) -- run the GAP-4 execution primitive (induce program from demos -> restricted-exec -> demo-fit selection) OFF-ARC on MBPP/EvalPlus, ACCUMULATING to power. The GAP-4 rule-execution verifier is domain-general BY CONSTRUCTION (induce program -> exec -> exact-output-match) but its off-ARC transfer is UNDER-MEASURED: exp4032 found no off-ARC transfer (delta_pp=5.0, CI95 [0.0,12.5] incl 0) at low n; GAP-CODE-EXEC-DEMOFIT is OPEN. Map: visible tests = demos (the induction signal), hidden tests = gold (the held-out target). Two arms: vote@1 (majority candidate) vs demo-fit selection (the candidate whose induced program passes the visible/demo tests). Decentralization: local SOTA GGUF generator (gemma-4-12B-it -- many candidates per task, fast), model-free execution verifier. ACCUMULATE-not-restart (memory powering-run-background-mechanism-fails + known-issues 'powering runs must accumulate'): resume the exp4032/exp4051/exp4063 EvalPlus checkpoint (corpus+model keyed, NOT exp-id keyed) and EXTEND n; report ACCUMULATED-N with a bootstrap CI. Gate: demo-fit selection earns held-out (hidden-test) headroom over vote (the ARC-1 analog: vote 0.4516 -> gated 0.5806). Emit off_arc_demofit_beats_vote BARE bool := (hidden-test demo-fit - vote > 0 AND CI95-excl-0). Execution-grounded => verifier_is_oracle=true (HONEST: the cheap/automatic/decentralized execution layer, NOT the oracle-distinct moat). HARD FLOOR: if accumulated n added < a real increment for this window AND the CI still includes 0, LOG the gap + flag for the 3-consecutive-window auto-retire check. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: off_arc_demofit_beats_vote_accumulated_ci_excludes_zero; results/experiment_4319_off_arc_execution_verifier_transfer_accumulate.json
